#: passwords.cpp:40
msgid "Echo Characters As"
msgstr "Håyner les caracteres tapés come"

#: passwords.cpp:42
msgid ""
"You can select the type of visual feedback given when you enter a password "
"in kdesu. Choose one of the following options:"
"<p> "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>1 star:</em> each character you type is shown as an asterisk (*) "
"symbol.</li> "
"<li><em>3 stars:</em> three asterisks are shown for each character you "
"type.</li> "
"<li><em>no echo:</em>"
" there is no visual feedback at all, so nothing on your screen shows how "
"many characters are in your password.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Vos ploz tchoezi çou k' est håyné cwand vos tapez on scret dins kdesu. "
"Tchoezixhoz ene des tchuzes shuvantes: "
"<p> "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>1 sitoele:</em> tchaeke caractere ki vos tapez est håyné come ene "
"sitoele (*).</li> "
"<li><em>3 stoeles:</em> troes stoeles sont håynêyes po tchaeke caractere "
"tapé.</li> "
"<li><em>rén do tot:</em> i gn a rén do tot k' est håyné cwand vos "
"tapez, i gn a do côp nén moyén di saveur kibén d' caracteres a vosse "
"sicret tot rwaitant l' waitroûle.</li></ul>"

#: passwords.cpp:49
msgid "&1 star"
msgstr "&1 sitoele"

#: passwords.cpp:50
msgid "&3 stars"
msgstr "&3 stoeles"

#: passwords.cpp:51
msgid "&No echo"
msgstr "&rén do tot"

#: passwords.cpp:56
msgid "&Remember passwords"
msgstr "Si &rmimbrer do scret"

#: passwords.cpp:57
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, kdesu will remember your passwords for the "
"specified amount of time. Until then, you will not have to enter your "
"password again. Keep in mind that this option is insecure and may enable "
"others to damage your system."
"<p> Please <em>do not</em>"
" use this option if you are working in an insecure environment, for example, "
"on a workstation that is located in a publicly accessible area."
"<p> This option does not affect passwords explicitly set in other "
"applications, for example, your email account password in KMail."
msgstr ""
"Ci cisse tchuze est clitcheye, kdesu si va rmimbrer vos screts pol tins "
"dné. Disk' adon, vos n' avoz nén a rtaper vosse sicret. Èn rovyîz nén "
"ki cisse tchuze ci pout esse on problinme pol såvrité di voste éndjole. "
"<p> Do côp, n' eployî <em>nén</em> cisse tchuze ci si vos ovrez dins on "
"evironmint ki vos n' avoz nén fiyate, par egzimpe, po on posse éndjolrece "
"metou dins ene plaece ki tot l' minme kî pout intrer."
"<p> Cisse tchuze chal n' afectêye nén les screts definis dins des ôtès "
"programes, come par egzimpe les screts po l' emilaedje dins KMail."

#: passwords.cpp:70
msgid ""
"You can specify how long kdesu will remember your passwords. A short timeout "
"is more secure than a long timeout."
msgstr ""
"Vos ploz defini po cbén d' tins ki kdesu s' doet rmimbrer des screts. On "
"court tårdjaedje dene pus di såvrité k' on long."

#: passwords.cpp:73
msgid "&Timeout:"
msgstr "&Tårdjaedje:"

#: passwords.cpp:76
msgid " min"
msgstr " min"

#: passwords.cpp:189
msgid ""
"<h1>Passwords</h1> This module gives you options for configuring the way in "
"which the \"kdesu\" program treats passwords. Kdesu will ask you for a "
"password when you try to carry out some privileged actions, such as changing "
"the date/time stored in your system clock, or adding new users on your "
"computer."
"<p> You can configure the type of visual feedback given when you type a "
"password, and whether kdesu should remember passwords for some time after "
"you have given them."
"<p> Note that these settings affect <em>only</em>"
" kdesu. This means that the behavior of passwords in KMail and other "
"programs cannot be configured here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Sicrets</h1> Ci module ci vos permete d' apontyî li manire ki "
"l' programe «kdesu» va ovrer avou les screts. Kdesu vos dmandrè po on "
"scret cwand vos sayroz di fé ene accion k' a mezåjhe di s' fé dizo "
"môde «root», come di candjî li date ou l' eure wårdés dins "
"l' ôrlodje do sistinme, ou radjouter des noveas uzeus so vosse copiutrece. "
"<p> Vos ploz apontyî çou k' on voet cwand on tape les screts, eyet si "
"kdesu doet s' rimimbrer des screts po on tins dné après ki vos ls avoz "
"tapé pol prumî côp. "
"<p> Notez ki ces apontiaedjes la afectèt <em>fok</em> kdesu. Dj' ô bén "
"ki l' dujhance des screts dins KMail eyet ds ôtes programes ni s' pout "
"nén apontyî chal."

